# Mode authority (UI)

- Demo: read-only — no submit mutations
- Paper: `canUsePaperActions` for controls; Workspace is submit boundary
- Live: observational only — no order submission

Frontend gating is not a security boundary. See [MODE_AUTHORITY.md](docs/architecture/MODE_AUTHORITY.md).
